      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُنْجُورٌ</span></b> : see the next preceding paragraph, in
three places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A small</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَط</span> [or <i>receptacle
for perfumes and the like</i>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A glass
flask</i> or <i>bottle</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَارُورَة</span>), (K, TA,) <i>of a small size,</i>
(TA,) <i>for</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَرِيرةَ</span> [q. v.]. (K, TA.)

